<title>HONG KONG: China grain/oilseed/meal deals reported April.</title>
<headline>China grain/oilseed/meal deals reported April.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Chinese grain, oilseeds and meal purchases and sales were reported in April in U.S. dollars per tonne, C&amp;F China, unless otherwise indicated:</p>
<p> Date	Commodity    Tonnes    Price	ETA China    Port</p>
<p> 17/4/97   S.American</p>
<p>	     soymeal	50,000   below 320   May	     --</p>
<p> 24/4/97   S.American</p>
<p>	     soymeal	100,000   304-310    May/June    S.China</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6358</p>
